              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Correct. Graph [A] vs. time and determine the slope of the tangent line at t = 5.0 s. This is the instantaneous rate of change of [A]. From the definition of reaction rate and the reaction stoichiometry, the instantaneous rate for the reaction = "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "4040639878",
                        "src": "-\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta\\lbrack\\mathrm A\\rbrack}{2\\;\\mathrm\\Delta t}",
                        "subtype": "latex",
                        "type": "formula_inline"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "no9pazxtuwes30e",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1823240873"
              },
              "id": "3003470198",
              "legacyMatch": "[0.016,0.024]",
              "rule": "input = {[0.016,0.024]}",
              "score": 10
            },
            {
              "feedback": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Incorrect. To find the instantaneous rate of reaction: "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "ph81w3pbad5924l",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "0by181cahk92v2m",
                            "text": "Carefully plot the [A] vs. t data and fit a smooth curve to the data points. The slope of the curve, which is "
                          },
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "4bsqlfskuf26ckt",
                                "text": ""
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "2ujm5ft1gspmu2v",
                            "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                            "src": "\\frac{\\triangle\\mathrm [A]}{\\triangle t}",
                            "subtype": "latex",
                            "type": "formula_inline"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "jo31t315whckgrk",
                            "text": ", at a given time is equal to the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "f2solipmp7fonti",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "f2rreij34lvot9m",
                            "text": "Carefully estimate the value of the slope at the given time to obtain the instantaneous rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "146rsv36huya00u",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "hqsbh17ugka3nh5",
                            "text": "Relate the rate of change of [A] to the reaction rate using the definition of reaction rate and the stoichiometric coefficient of the reactant A."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "mgd3quxekywyola",
                        "type": "li"
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "tgenbvqswbv1q7z",
                            "text": "Solve for the reaction rate using the estimated rate of change of [A]."
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "ssxe1wvyrofdfro",
                        "type": "li"
                      }
